## Why This Is Asked
Tests production-like asynchronous data paths and cross-region consistency, with failure modes that surface race conditions and retry logic.

## Key Concepts
- Asynchronous batch processing
- Eventual consistency across regions
- Idempotency and replay safety
- Observability: traces, metrics, logs
- Failure modes: MQ, workers, storage

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: polling for report readiness
async function waitForReport(token){
  while(true){
    const r = await fetch(`/tenant/a/reports/${token}`)
    if(r.status===200 && r.json().state==='READY') return r.json()
    await sleep(1000)
  }
}
```

